<title>AUSTRALIA: Climax says enters Philippines venture.</title>
<headline>Climax says enters Philippines venture.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Climax Mining Ltd said on Monday it had entered a joint venture agreement with Cyprus Amax Minerals Co to advance its Surigao Peninsula tenements on the southern Philippines island of Mindanao.</p>
<p>Climax said it has at least four prospects in the region which exhibit promising gold and copper mineralisation.</p>
<p>Under the agreement, a Cyprus Amax subsidiary has the right to earn a 60 percent interest in the assets through a drilling programme.</p>
<p>Climax declined to give details of proposed expenditure.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1871</p>
</text>
